  ------- 
  This is SD-code to prepare initial wavefunctions with full-grid in G-space needed for
  the TDDFT calculation within static DFT.
  Disclosure of this code was kindly agreed by Osamu Sugino, Yoshihide Yoshimoto, Atsushi Oshiyama,
  Kenji Shiraishi,Takashi Nakayama, and Mineo Saito.
  ------- 
